WEBVTT

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:04.733
For 28 months, one watch counted every heartbeat.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.833
1,003 activities.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.967
4,438 kilometres.

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:13.967
Walks, runs, hikes, and the gym.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:18.200
In atlas mode, every route comes back as light.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.867
717 days on the move.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:25.233
235 of them in a row.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.333
Pick any day, and it plays again.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.700
Ten set out together.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.033
One stays at every moment that mattered, all the way to the finish.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.700
44 variables become 34 facts.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:39.867
4.

00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:41.200
9 million steps.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.200
6 am starts.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.433
And Sundays carry the week.

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:49.267
Watch it as a story, or dig through the tabs.

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:55.233
Every number, straight from the watch.

00:00:55.233 --> 00:00:57.267
Come and find your day:

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.500
sankettambare.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.467
in/training
